Root cause:
The bug was caused by missing graph connections in the device tree source (DTS) that connect the TCON (Timing Controller) TOP to the individual TCONs used for TV outputs. The absence of these connections likely resulted in incorrect behavior or functionality of HDMI and TV display features, leading to issues when trying to render video output properly. The patch aimed to establish these necessary connections, ensuring the proper transmission of signals between components.
